Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "You there! We need your help to defeat
a terrible monster named Volga!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "You're in trouble...? Sounds like a job
for a hero!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "That Volga character will lose! Seems likely
since I have the legendary hammer!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "It's too dangerous to go alone! Hurry, you
need to get outside and rescue Darunia!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Coming alone... How foolish. Meet me
in battle, if you wish to perish.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "The monsters are all huddled? That makes
it easier to mash 'em all with one swing!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Things are looking dire! Hurry, and save
Darunia from himself!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "To join with him, you'll first need to
open the temple's entrance.",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Leave it to us! We'll get that door open!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Hrk... At this rate, we'll never even
reach the door...!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Grah! We're getting beaten! Goro!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "...Huh? Oh no! This gate is broken!
I can't fix this by myself!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Broken?! No... Join with the others, and
try to find a solution!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "I bet if we work together, we'll be able
to fix that door in no time at all!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "If those Gorons are defeated, then we'll
never get that door open!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "You want door opened?
We do it for you! Gya ha!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "The door's open! Ah! And the enemy's
already pouring in!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Darunia will not survive on his own if
we don't help. We must act quickly!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Yeah, we need to hurry!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Hya! Crush their puny base!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "The enemy is targeting our base! We'll
lose everything if we don't protect it!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Don't worry! I can protect the base!
It'll be no problem at all!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Hey, a gate just opened. Looks like
we've got more monsters coming in!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Thanks for the save! Now, why don't we
go knock Volga around, huh? Ha ha ha!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Are you sure you're OK? There is a high
chance you have a concussion...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Darunia! Don't be reckless!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "We can finally catch our breath, but
be careful. We're not done yet!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Kya! Swarm their base!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Gya! Gorons too tough!
Destroy them!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Door closed? Hya! Smash it open!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Gya! Now we make for their base!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Gyarg! Weaklings...beat meeeeeee!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Are you scared yet, lizards? We're not
so dainty!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Yes! Looks like our base is all right.
I think the monsters are backing down!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Kyah! You...defeat...me...?
Carelessssssss!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Phew! I'm just glad we stopped those
scaly things.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Good, with those foul snakes defeated,
our base should be easier to defend.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Our base is safe again!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Ugh... It's so tiring having to beat them
back again and again...",
  "1.0.40.0" => "They've slain my allies? Hmm... Perhaps
they are worthy of a challenge after all.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "All right! Now I'll take down that Volga!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Hah, you'll find that I'm not so easily
trifled with.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Gah! Come on! I'll never get to the
dragon knight if this keeps up!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Oh no! Go help Darunia!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "I can help!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Drat. This keep is shut tight... How
am I gonna move forward now?",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Whoo, they're tougher than I expected!
This is gonna get rocky...!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Grah! I'm rock sirloin if I don't
get some help or something!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Hey, Volga! If you're so tough, fight me
yourself! Leave the cronies outta this!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "An interesting proposition. If you made it
this far, you're worth my true strength!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Go, help Darunia! He doesn't realize
what he's getting himself into!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "If we work together, I know we can beat
him!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "We're being pushed back...? But how? The
Gorons are strong, but not this strong.",
  "1.0.54.0" => "I'll flatten you all! Ga ha ha!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Anyone else like a little taste of
a Goron's hammer?!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Haaa... I hate being forced to retreat,
but we must. Full retreat!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "We did it! Thanks for the help, brother.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Brother? More like SISTER! Ha ha ha!
Oh wait, the compass! It's glowing again!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Grk--! They got me...",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Our base! How did we let it fall?",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Outta my way! That pathetic
fire muncher is mine!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "The Gorons fixing the door are being
targeted! Someone, protect them!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "If someone needs protecting, then leave it
to the legendary hero herself! I'm on it!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "We did it! The door's open!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Wonderful! Is Darunia OK?",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Huh? The temple opened from the inside!
What in the world just happened?",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Wasn't the door broken? Doesn't matter!
My brothers need me to smash Volga now!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "RAAAAH! I'm not about to die in a
place like this!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Stop the monsters! We can't let them
get into our base!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "My brothers... They're all fighting so hard.
I can't let them down!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Darunia's in trouble! We must save him,
right away!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "I can open that keep, no problem!
I just need to get in front of the gate!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Don't give up! We're coming to rescue
you! Just hold on a little longer!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "If anyone is gonna crush Volga,
it's gonna be ME!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "We have to keep up with Darunia!
Hurry! Follow him into battle!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "If we work together to protect the base,
the enemy won't stand a chance!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Oops, I think I broke the door. In any
case, they should be safe inside.",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Must be because we drove off the
monsters. Anyway, off to Hyrule Castle!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "The only one who knows how to get inside
the temple is Ruto. We must protect her.",
  "13.0.1.0" => "I'll go help our allies. I leave the
floodgates to you.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "If that one's a fake, then we need to
figure out its REAL identity.",
  "13.0.3.0" => "I'll search the east. The rest of you,
search the west.",
  "13.0.4.0" => "So, she still insists that she's the
princess? How puzzling...",
  "13.0.5.0" => "It appears that the enemy is targeting us.",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Well done. Now, we must attack the
Water Temple.",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Good, we should head to the front as
well.",
  "13.0.8.0" => "We're being pushed back... This is
concerning.",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Thank you. I should be all right. Please,
go look for the floodgate switch.",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Good, the water seems to have receded.",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Now we can rescue Princess Ruto.",
  "13.0.12.0" => "All we can do for now is take this keep.",
  "13.0.13.0" => "The enemy is taken care of. All that's left
is that impostor!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "I'm sorry... Forgive me...",
  "13.0.15.0" => "We managed to open the way, even
without a plan.",
  "13.0.16.0" => "That one could be a threat! We must fall
back to the keep!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Hmm... If the impostor was able to call forth
THAT creature, then I think I know who she is...",
  "13.0.18.0" => "We can't continue this fight without
Princess Ruto...",
  "13.0.19.0" => "Let's wipe out the enemy around here first. We
can flank them by leaping from the North Cliff.",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Thank you for saving me. Now, please,
Ruto needs you more than I do!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "You've saved me... Thank you, I should
be fine.",
  "13.0.22.0" => "We've managed to stop them somehow...",
  "13.0.23.0" => "No... We've managed to embolden our
foes!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "We can't continue this fight without
Princess Ruto...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Let's wipe out the enemy around here first. We
can flank them by leaping from the North Cliff.",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Thank you for saving me. Now, please,
Ruto needs you more than I do!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "You've saved me... Thank you, I should
be fine.",
  "13.0.39.0" => "We've managed to stop them somehow...",
  "13.0.40.0" => "No... We've managed to embolden our
foes!",
  "13.0.52.0" => "Without Princess Ruto, our efforts will
be in vain...",
  "13.0.53.0" => "We must first dispatch the enemies before
us, then flank the rest from the north.",
}